            `at the time had with him an article manufactured for the purpose of producing a practical effect by explosion` IS `at the time I had with me an article manufactured to produce a practical effect by explosion`
            `at the time had with him an article he intended for the purpose of producing a practical effect by explosion` IS `at the time I had with me an article I intended to use to produce a practical effect by explosion`
