      `I had other lawful authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you have other lawful authority?
      `I took it for my own or another's use` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you take it for your own or another person's use?
      `I drove it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you drive it?
      `I allowed myself to be carried in or on it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you allow yourself to be carried in or on it?
      `I knew it had been taken without such consent or authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that it had been taken without the owner's consent or other lawful authority?
      `I believed I had lawful authority to do what I did` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you believe that you had lawful authority to do what you did?
