      `by then the vehicle had been recovered, for circumstance (d), damage was caused to the vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When it happened, had the vehicle already been recovered, that is restored to its owner or to other lawful possession or custody? [circumstance (d), damage was caused to the vehicle]
