            `he assisted in the retention, removal, disposal or realisation of the goods by or for the benefit of another person` IS `I assisted in their retention, removal, disposal or realisation by or for the benefit of another`
            `he arranged to receive them, or to undertake or assist in their retention, removal, disposal or realisation` IS `I arranged to receive them, or to undertake or assist in their retention, removal, disposal or realisation`
        `the goods of my handling facts` MEANS `Goods facts` WITH
            `where the goods came from` IS `where the goods came from`
            `they are land, or a thing forming part of land that has not been severed from it by stealing` IS `they are land, or a thing forming part of land not yet severed by stealing`
            `the stealing, or the blackmail, was an offence under this Act` IS `the stealing or blackmail was an offence under this Act`
